#: ../../source/module/training-audit-overview.md:1
#: e6826131cdce4feaa9f535900d4382ca
msgid "概览与快速体检"
msgstr "Overview and quick health check"

#: ../../source/module/training-audit-overview.md:3
#: 9a6ef1cc98254cc39fd5d56e34ae6844
msgid "先看当前结论和数据概况，再处理训练阻塞项与建议复核项。"
msgstr ""
"Read the current conclusion and data summary first, then handle training "
"blockers and recommended review items."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:680
#: 50785f8e71114a4eb7fbf3f8837cf1e8
msgid "「概览」先回答 3 个问题："
msgstr "The Overview answers three questions first:"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:682
#: 376bcc76a7bb4b1ca4702cdf019a6ff5
msgid "有没有空结构、非法数值、标签形状错误等训练阻塞项；"
msgstr ""
"Are there blockers such as empty structures, invalid values, or malformed"
" labels?"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:683
#: e61796a0f7c849f2b3788bfc5714cad4
msgid "当前数据包含哪些精确组分、元素和标签；"
msgstr "Which exact compositions, elements, and labels are present?"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:684
#: afe6540e334d4c379eede8af0f6d41b0
msgid "哪些高力、高能量、重复或低频集合值得先复核。"
msgstr ""
"Which high-force, high-energy, duplicate, or low-frequency groups should "
"be reviewed first?"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:686
#: bba025bb403b45bca691f72cae5feac5
msgid "点击复核项后，下方会显示观察事实、解释和能力边界。再点击显示结构按钮，即可返回原页面，并选中该项对应的真实结构。"
msgstr ""
"After selecting a review item, the panel below shows observations, "
"explanations, and capability limits. Click Show structures to return to "
"the original page with the corresponding structures selected."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:688
#: a4b7eacd8edd4468847891aeb3ad2b0d
msgid "训练集评估概览页，标出当前结论、数据概况、建议复核顺序和 HTML 报告导出入口"
msgstr ""
"Training Set Audit overview showing the current conclusion, data summary,"
" recommended review order, and HTML report export"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:688
#: a4b7eacd8edd4468847891aeb3ad2b0d
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/training_set_audit_overview.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/training_set_audit_overview.png"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:693
#: 6dd1651d8d6546599dfdae5f309d7502
msgid ""
"图中的编号就是推荐阅读顺序：先读当前结论，再确认本次检查了多少结构和标签，随后按「建议下一步」进入复核队列。只有需要留档或发给合作者时，才使用右上角的"
" HTML 导出。"
msgstr ""
"The numbers in the figure show the recommended reading order: read the "
"current conclusion first, confirm how many structures and labels were "
"checked, and then use “Suggested next step” to open the review queue. Use"
" the HTML export in the upper-right only when you need an archive or a "
"report for collaborators."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3286
#: dea1e34e198e460b826e0b87669969b5
msgid "快速体检检查什么"
msgstr "What the quick health check covers"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3288
#: dbade2be444f4fcd98c137f76b5add40
msgid "训练阻塞项"
msgstr "Training blockers"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3290
#: 1a152a39bc4844f6b7f6a7934a14ea86
#
msgid "以下结果违反明确的数据格式要求，应在训练前处理："
msgstr "The following results violate explicit data-format requirements and should be handled before training:"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3292
#: 9812d5e7b2c24f13b0a8990150bd1881
msgid "空结构；"
msgstr "empty structures;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3293
#: a3731767d58448d39baa8e4ff6ab8ec4
msgid "位置、晶胞或标签中的 `NaN / Inf`；"
msgstr "`NaN / Inf` in positions, cells, or labels;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3294
#: 0c0b8cf5b0884cf28c205b4980ae2799
msgid "位置、力、virial 等数组形状错误；"
msgstr "incorrect array shapes for positions, forces, virials, and similar fields;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3295
#: 7b5f36f629ed4a0ab858722482df7e1b
msgid "周期方向与晶胞不一致；"
msgstr "periodic directions inconsistent with the cell;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3296
#: 63600a988a9b4a76b9f2b06e245155b3
msgid "未知元素，或元素数量与原子数不一致；"
msgstr "unknown elements, or an element count inconsistent with the atom count;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3297
#: e0c2fb3b6aba4104b015e32edd4c37d7
msgid "最短原子距离小于 `0.5 Å` 的保守重叠信号；"
msgstr ""
"a conservative overlap signal with a shortest atomic distance below `0.5 "
"Å`;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3298
#: a9c45cf6e960466396533983fa27b383
msgid "相同几何对应互相冲突的能量、力或 virial 标签。"
msgstr "conflicting energy, force, or virial labels for the same geometry."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3300
#: a1d587a1498940f9a3b577d510b16ac6
msgid ""
"相同几何按元素、周期边界、晶胞和坐标共同判断；晶胞与坐标比较到小数点后 8 位。冲突标签的当前绝对容差为：能量 `1 × 10⁻⁵`、力 `1 ×"
" 10⁻⁵`、virial `1 × 10⁻⁴`，相对容差为 `0`。"
msgstr ""
"The same geometry is identified from its elements, periodic boundaries, "
"cell, and coordinates; cells and coordinates are compared to 8 decimal "
"places. The current absolute tolerances for conflicting labels are `1 × "
"10⁻⁵` for energy and force and `1 × 10⁻⁴` for virial, with a relative "
"tolerance of `0`."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3302
#: d14106c9b995470c937ef301261046db
msgid "软件不会自动删除阻塞结构，也不会替用户决定哪一次重复计算才正确。应先回到结构来源和 DFT 输出核对。"
msgstr ""
"The application does not delete blockers automatically or decide which "
"duplicate calculation is correct. Check the structure source and DFT "
"output first."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3304
#: 28349980520b4de7ae220c4245a0d5c8
msgid "建议复核项"
msgstr "Recommended review items"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3306
#: ffe0f23bcfb34e89aaaaa606ff35593f
msgid "最大力最高的 10%；"
msgstr "the top 10% by maximum force;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3307
#: 811da632e0b543cfb82b6fa55884642c
msgid "单原子能量最高的 5%；"
msgstr "the top 5% by per-atom energy;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3308
#: bab5d521285c4eb5907134d62cf7753f
msgid "重复几何；"
msgstr "duplicate geometries;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3309
#: db8375b6661440778e4ab88c0d1203ba
msgid "当前数据内部的低频组分、低频局域环境或不平衡集合。"
msgstr ""
"low-frequency compositions, local environments, or imbalanced groups in "
"the current data."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:3311
#: efd095a00a1e42808292e046b8ce2a69
msgid "固定分位集合按排名必然产生。高力、高能量或重复结构可能来自真实目标物理、显式加权或独立计算，因此这些结果是复核入口，不是删除建议。"
msgstr ""
"Fixed-quantile groups are produced directly from ranking. High-force, "
"high-energy, or duplicate structures may reflect the intended physics, "
"explicit weighting, or independent calculations, so these results are "
"review entry points rather than deletion recommendations."
